  "summary": "Chloe is a Software Engineer with 3.5 years of front-end web development experience specializing in React and Javascript. Domain expert in marketing and cloud Machine Learning as a Service field as a result of working at Tealium.\n\nChloe is open to business emails at chloenguyenpro@gmail.com, and will attempt to answer emails in a timely manner. She is interested in mid level Frontend Engineer roles and entry Fullstack Engineer roles.\n\nAt Tealium, Chloe worked with Product Managers, UI designers, and Data Scientists to bring UI and UX enhancements to Tealium’s cloud machine-learning (ML) platform, easing adoption of ML initiatives for enterprise customers’ digital marketing strategies.\n\nChloe is a Computer Science BS graduate from the University of California, Irvine. During her time there, she has done projects in artificial intelligence, computer networking, computational photography, requirements engineering, and computer graphics. After graduating, she's worked at a health startup named Walking Doctors and developed a web app portal for healthcare professionals to give hundreds of patients care in rural Indonesia.",
